==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*7 [[Doge]]s spawn after 18 seconds<sup>540f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

